      "detailed_description": "<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/9e031c9e2a164c0ad1fa9bb1dafc5713.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an alternate French Revolution infused with fantasy in this acclaimed turn-based strategy JRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deluxe Edition includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full base game: <strong>Banner of the Maid</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thrilling paid DLC: <strong>The Oriental Pirate</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Pauline Bonaparte as she rises from young officer to leader amid the chaos of revolutionary Paris, then set sail with the Chinese Pirate Confederation. Team up with the fearless pirate Mu Zhiyun, unlock brand-new challenge missions, and command an entirely new unit type!</p></p><br><h1>Steam Deck Verified</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/944be2dec4560f3e1b3d6f810d2a822a.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fc6afc106ed24599daf252451feb8626.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=48 height=73 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fc6afc106ed24599daf252451feb8626.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Banner of the Maid is a strategy RPG that blends the tactical depth of 90s Japanese classics with a vibrant anime art style.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate 1790s, you play as the brilliant Pauline Bonaparte. Lead your troops to victory in turn-based battles and navigate the treacherous political salons of Paris to rewrite the fate of the Revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the golden age of grid-based strategy. Command Line Infantry, Skirmishers, Cavalry, and Artillery in complex battlefields. You must master unit counters, exploit terrain advantages (High Ground for aim, Grass for evasion), and adapt to dynamic weather changes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Anime Art Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bold reimagining of 18th-century France. The game features over 30 unique characters designed with a distinct anime style that contrasts sharply yet beautifully with the historical setting. From the mud of the battlefield to the gilded halls of the Tuileries, the art brings a unique flair to historical figures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions &amp; Political Intrigue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war isn't just fought with muskets. Between missions, you must navigate the Malmaison Salon. Complete quests and gain favor with rival factions—the Royalists, the Jacobins, and the Parisians. Your political standing isn't just for show; it unlocks special funding, rare weapons, and can even open up secret story routes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream army. Each general has unique skills and growth potential. Customize their loadouts, learn their personal stories to unlock passive bonuses, and promote them into advanced classes. Experiment with different skill combinations to create a force that suits your tactical style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
