mic weather changes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Anime Art Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bold reimagining of 18th-century France. The game features over 30 unique characters designed with a distinct anime style that contrasts sharply yet beautifully with the historical setting. From the mud of the battlefield to the gilded halls of the Tuileries, the art brings a unique flair to historical figures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions &amp; Political Intrigue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war isn't just fought with muskets. Between missions, you must navigate the Malmaison Salon. Complete quests and gain favor with rival factions—the Royalists, the Jacobins, and the Parisians. Your political standing isn't just for show; it unlocks special funding, rare weapons, and can even open up secret story routes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.mp4?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream army. Each general has unique skills and growth potential. Customize their loadouts, learn their personal stories to unlock passive bonuses, and promote them into advanced classes. Experiment with different skill combinations to create a force that suits your tactical style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.poster.avif?t=1770715604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.webm?t=1770715604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc